# ============================================================================
# Chharizard .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb: nothing character-specific, nothing with real names,
# nothing with local machine paths ever hits the public repo.
# ============================================================================

# --- Character-specific config (PRIVACY) ---
# The roster lists actual in-game FFXI character names. NEVER commit.
**/data/roster.json
**/data/roster.lua
**/data/per_toon/
**/data/state_*.lua
**/data/state_v*.lua
**/data/*.log
**/data/backup.json
**/data/enabled.json

# --- Character-specific gearswap files ---
# The public repo ships templates in gearswap/templates/ only.
# Character-bound files go in your local Windower install, not here.
gearswap/data/
!gearswap/templates/
**/*_Chharzilla.lua
**/*_Chharith.lua
**/*_Chharutaru.lua
**/*_Chharlotte.lua
**/*_Chharity.lua
**/*_Chhardonnay.lua
**/*_Chharburzt.lua

# --- Windower runtime state ---
scripts/init.txt
scripts/*_init.txt

# --- Compiled / build output ---
Chharizard/build/*.exe
Chharizard/build/*.pdb
Chharizard/build/*.log
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp

# --- Tune-FFXI backups (contain machine-specific settings) ---
tune-ffxi/Revert/
tune-ffxi/*.log

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Temp / logs ---
*.tmp
*.bak
*.old
*.log
!CHANGELOG.md

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
